 stasis and you need earlier Magic Defense shred.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"holy-crystal\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when your front line consistently peels assassins and the final slot can stay pure damage.\"}],\"notes\":\"Defensive mid build for suppressive pick comps and assassin-heavy drafts where one saved combo matters more than maximum damage.\",\"totalCost\":10960,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"magicpower\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPower\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":270,\"sources\":[\"Clock of Destiny\",\"Lightning Truncheon\",\"Divine Glaive\",\"Blood Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"adaptiveatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.adaptiveAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":45,\"sources\":[\"Winter Crown\"]},{\"key\":\"magicpen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPenetration\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Divine Glaive\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":800,\"sources\":[\"Clock of Destiny\",\"Winter Crown\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":18,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"mp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.mana\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":800,\"sources\":[\"Clock of Destiny\",\"Lightning Truncheon\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":25,\"sources\":[\"Clock of Destiny\",\"Lightning Truncheon\",\"Winter Crown\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=kagura\u0026items=tough-boots%2Cclock-of-destiny%2Clightning-truncheon%2Cwinter-crown%2Cdivine-glaive%