nt umbrella passed down from the legendary Onmyouji Master. The umbrella allows her to channel powerful magic, creating barriers and pulling enemies to their doom. Despite her youth, Kagura's mastery over Seimei is unmatched, earning her respect across the realm. She ventured beyond her homeland to find Hayabusa, a childhood companion who disappeared on a secret mission.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"hayabusa\",\"heroName\":\"Hayabusa\",\"relationship\":\"Childhood companion and closest friend\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"hanabi\",\"heroName\":\"Hanabi\",\"relationship\":\"Fellow ninja-clan member from the Cadia Riverlands\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"esmeralda\",\"heroName\":\"Esmeralda\",\"relationship\":\"Mystical ally who studies celestial phenomena\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"valentina\",\"heroName\":\"Valentina\",\"relationship\":\"Dark queen who desires Seimei's power\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"selena\",\"heroName\":\"Selena\",\"relationship\":\"Abyssal priestess whose magic opposes her light\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"Kagura\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":51.35,\"pickRate\":0.66,\"banRate\":0.99},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"winRate\":51.41,\"pickRate\":0.66,\"banRate\":0.99},{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"winRate\":51.19,\"pickRate\":0.68,\"banRate\":1.03},{\"date\":\"2026-09-28\",\"winRate\":52.43,\"pickRate\":0.72,\"banRate\":1.28},{\"date\":\"2026-10-02\",\"winRate\":52.35,\"pickRate\":0.69,\"banRate\":1.22},{\"date\":\"2026-10-09\",\"winRate\":51.92,\"pickRate\":0.67,\"banRate\":1.14},{\"date\":\"2026-10-17\",\"winRate\":51.8,\"pickRate\":0.73,\"banRate\":1.13}]},\"relatedHeroesSlot\":\"$L66\",\"statsSeoSlot\":\"$L67\",\"fieldManualSlot\":\"$L68\"}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L69\",null,{\"heroName\":\"Kagura\",\"heroSlug\":\"kagura\",\"roles\":\"$60:props:hero:role\",\"lanes\":\"$60:props:hero:lane\",\"difficulty\":3,\"winRate\":51.8,\"pickRate\":0.73,\"banRate\":1.13,\"curatedBuilds\":\"$60:props:curatedBuilds\",\"topCounters\":\"$60:props:tabData:counterData:countersThis